  "text6": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2"
    },
    "text": "Why we wanted one queue"
   }
  },
  "text7": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "Two years ago every team ran its own broker. Each one had its own retry rules, its own dashboards and its own idea of what a dead letter was. When something went wrong at night, the first hour went to finding out where the message had even been.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body"
    }
   }
  },
  "text8": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "We set ourselves a simple goal: one queue, one set of guarantees, and a migration that no team had to schedule around. It took us three quarters, and most of what we learned was not about the queue at all.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body"
    }
   }
  },
